# Hookline Stack (CIPlay hookline_stack): the Union hall, the charter, the hall desk (engine controls), crane three,
# the foreman's box (metal detector), the flare store (firework), crane three's cab (zipline); then the contract: the
# missing expedition notice, the dive rope, two salvage caches on the street below, the tally, the Union's receipt.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Hookline Stack
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Salvagers' Union
zone union_hall
expect step 1
read Union charter
expect step 2
read Council requisition
expect step 3
open Hall desk
wait 3
expect step 4
# STORY 10-24: the climb first, for Bram's strongroom key
zone hk_trail
expect step 5
openat 1.88 -64.26
zone hk_summit
expect step 6
expect stand -0.28 -56.71 h=36
open Dragline's boom ladder deck box
wait 3
expect story hk_top 1
expect step 7
zone crane_3
expect step 8
open Foreman's box
wait 3
expect step 9
open Flare store
wait 3
expect step 10
zone spoil_heap
expect step 11
open Toppled crane's toolbox
wait 3
expect step 12
read Tally book
expect step 13
zone divers_cave
expect step 14
read Bram's tonnage note
expect step 15
zone hk_deep
expect step 16
expect stand 75 -28 h=-16
open Union strongroom strongbox
wait 3
expect story hk_deep 1
expect step 17
read Bram's letter
expect step 18
open Crane cab
wait 3
expect done
expect step 0 quest=2
expect title Lost Below quest=2
read Missing expedition notice
expect step 1 quest=2
zone dive_rope
expect step 2 quest=2
openat -40 -24
openat -42 -15
expect story salvagetag 2
expect step 3 quest=2
use tally
read Union receipt
expect done quest=2
